---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import Testimonials from '../components/Testimonials.astro';
import { testimonials } from '../data/testimonials';

// Content from Vincent's briefing. The chapters deliberately avoid dates, qualifications and job titles that are not confirmed.
const stats = [
  { k: '26 years', v: 'Exploring communication and human behaviour' },
  { k: 'Around ten years', v: 'Full-time executive coaching' },
  { k: 'Hundreds', v: 'Of people worked with' },
];
const chapters = [
  { n: '01', t: 'Commercial career', b: 'Years in international financial technology and commercial leadership, including London and Hong Kong, taught me how pressure shapes decisions and what delay costs. Work associated with GL Trade, SunGard, FIS and Glownet.' },
  { n: '02', t: 'Executive coaching', b: 'Around ten years as a full-time executive coach, working with hundreds of people on trust, difficult conversations, responsibility, conflict and alignment.' },
  { n: '03', t: 'Kuma Partners', b: 'As a founding partner I help build a practice that combines executive advisory, team diagnostics, coaching and strategic facilitation for founders and leadership teams.' },
];
const earlier = [testimonials.kwok, testimonials.smahil];
const beliefs = [
  { t: 'People are rarely the problem in isolation.', b: 'The difficulty is often in the relationship, the system or the conversation that never took place. Understanding the pattern is more useful than looking for someone to blame.' },
  { t: 'Accountability can be generous.', b: 'Being responsible for your impact does not require being harsh with yourself or others. It means being willing to see reality, own your choices and change your behaviour.' },
  { t: 'Better tools do not guarantee better collaboration.', b: 'I am optimistic about AI. The organisations that thrive will also deliberately develop the human capabilities that technology does not automatically supply.' },
];
---
<Layout
  path="/about"
  type="ProfilePage"
  title="About Vincent Azé | Executive Coach, Kuma Partners"
  description="Vincent Azé is a Lisbon-based executive coach and Kuma Partners founding partner. 26 years exploring human behaviour, around ten as a full-time coach."
>
  <section class="bg-charcoal text-bone">
    <div class="container-x py-16 lg:py-28">
      <p class="label text-amber">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.08] text-bone max-w-[22ch] text-balance">I have spent 26 years learning how people really talk to each other.</h1>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-fog">
        <p>I began exploring communication and personal development 26 years ago. It changed how I understood relationships, empathy and responsibility, and what a single honest conversation can make possible.</p>
        <p>My career then took me into international financial technology and commercial relationships, including years in London and Hong Kong. It was an education in ambition, performance and pressure.</p>
        <p>Over time one question became more interesting to me than the technology or the commercial model: why do highly capable people sometimes struggle so much to work together? That question took me into full-time executive coaching.</p>
        <p>Today I am based in Lisbon and am a founding partner of Kuma Partners. I specialise in the conversations people postpone, and in helping them address what is unspoken, rebuild trust and work together more effectively. I have not mastered human behaviour. It is more complicated than any method suggests, and I am still learning.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-line bg-cream/70" aria-label="Credentials">
    <div class="container-x py-8 lg:py-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      {stats.map((x) => (
        <p class="text-sm text-steel"><span class="block text-2xl text-ink">{x.k}</span>{x.v}</p>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-line" aria-labelledby="path-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-12 lg:py-20">
      <p class="label text-steel">The path here</p>
      <h2 id="path-heading" class="mt-2 mb-10 text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink text-balance">Three chapters.</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12">
        {chapters.map((e) => (
          <div class="border-t border-line-strong pt-5">
            <span class="block text-xs text-amber-deep tabular-nums">{e.n}</span>
            <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl md:text-2xl text-ink leading-snug">{e.t}</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-[1.7] text-steel">{e.b}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="earlier-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-12 lg:py-20">
      <p class="label text-steel">Earlier chapters</p>
      <h2 id="earlier-heading" class="mt-2 mb-10 text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink text-balance">What colleagues and clients wrote about my commercial years.</h2>
      <Testimonials items={earlier} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="belief-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-12 lg:py-20">
      <p class="label text-steel">Point of view</p>
      <h2 id="belief-heading" class="mt-2 mb-10 text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink">What I believe about leadership.</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12">
        {beliefs.map((b) => (
          <div class="border-t border-line-strong pt-5">
            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-ink leading-snug">{b.t}</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-[56ch] leading-[1.7] text-steel">{b.b}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="personal-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-12 lg:py-20 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <p class="label text-steel">Personal note</p>
        <h2 id="personal-heading" class="mt-2 text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink text-balance">Outside the meeting room.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 lg:mt-0 lg:col-span-8 max-w-2xl space-y-5 leading-[1.7] text-steel">
        <p>I grew up in the south of France, which gave me a European and cross-cultural outlook. I value movement, time outdoors and the kind of open conversation that changes how you see something. Living and working across different countries has made me curious about the assumptions people bring into the same room without noticing.</p>
        <p>I enjoy meeting people who are building things, whether they are entrepreneurs, operators, technologists or simply people questioning how work could be better.</p>
        <p>Kuma Partners, the firm I co-founded, is at <a class="border-b border-ink text-ink" href={site.links.kuma} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">kuma.partners<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>. My partner Dr. Sven Mulfinger advises executives one to one at <a class="border-b border-ink text-ink" href={site.links.sven} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mulfinger.com<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-charcoal text-bone">
    <div class="container-x py-14 lg:py-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl max-w-[20ch] mx-auto text-balance">Bring the question that matters.</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl mx-auto text-fog leading-relaxed">If you are leading through an inflection point, dealing with a difficult relationship or thinking about what AI means for your team, I would be glad to explore it with you.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary mt-8">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
